{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14897","headline":"书情上大尹十兄 · 卢纶","name":"书情上大尹十兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫陌绝纤埃，油幢千骑来。\n剖辞纷若雨，犇吏殷成雷。\n圣泽初忧壅，羣心本在台。\n海鳞方泼刺，云翼暂徘徊。\n芳室芝兰茂，春蹊桃李开。\n江湖余派少，鸿鴈远声哀。\n命厌蓍龟诱，年惊弟侄催。\n磨铅慙砥砺，挥策愧驽骀。\n玉管能喧谷，金炉可变灰。\n应怜费思者，衔泪亦衔枚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}